 g forward.\n Who is the day for?  Year 12 students who may be interested
  in pursuing a subject like Law\, English\, History\, Classics\, Archaeol
 ogy\, or Languages at a selective university\, but would like more help 
 deciding which is the right subject for them.\n We also welcome applicati
 ons from school groups of higher attaining year 11 students who are plann
 ing to study Arts and Humanities A-level
